{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/810967-aboriginal-australian-pantheon-self-made-not-canon","id":810967,"title":"Aboriginal Australian pantheon? (Self made not Canon)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-17T22:15:57-08:00","id":810967,"title":"Aboriginal Australian pantheon? (Self made not Canon)","content":"So I've been trying desperately to find mythology and information about aboriginal Australia, like myths, gods, and the like. This is for the purpose of creating a pantheon, or at least a nailed down part of one, for one of my players to create a scion.<br /> <br /> I'm having trouble finding a lot of information, since, of course, aboriginal Australia was made up of a continent-spanning array of tribes and cultures, who obviously didn't share precisely identical myths and stories.<br /> I'm really just looking for a common theme of myths throughout Australian mythology to piecemeal together a worthwhile and non-horrifically inaccurate and insensitive pantheon.<br /> <br /> With what I've found so far, I've gathered enough general mythological information to start putting together a Pantheon Purview, which I've decided to call Dreaming. It basically allows for scions to access the power to reshape reality and while surviving in the harshness of reality as it currently exists.<br /> <br /> Does anyone have access to information/websites that detail some of the common themes of aboriginal australian mythology? My search thus far has included several google searches of varying detail, so any help I could get would be seriously appreciated.<br /> <br /> Thanks!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10163-toomuchjesus","name":"Toomuchjesus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-17T22:40:24-08:00","id":810977,"title":"","content":"I'd honestly try to narrow yourself down to one single tribe or at least *language* group. As you noted, there were several. That way you'll be able to direct your research more, and come up with a more respectful, honest treatment. <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Australian_Aboriginal_languages\" target=\"_blank\">Language group</a> is a good way to start!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-17T22:52:32-08:00","id":810982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Telgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/810967-aboriginal-australian-pantheon-self-made-not-canon?p=810977#post810977\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd honestly try to narrow yourself down to one single tribe or at least *language* group. As you noted, there were several. That way you'll be able to direct your research more, and come up with a more respectful, honest treatment. <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Australian_Aboriginal_languages&amp;quot;]Language</a> group[/URL] is a good way to start!</div> </div> </div> </div>This is an awesome idea, thanks! I was also thinking I should, at least for now, narrow it down to God's who would match the kind of scion my player is looking to create?<br /> That at least is an option if I'm running out of time before the campaign.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10163-toomuchjesus","name":"Toomuchjesus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T02:12:21-08:00","id":815319,"title":"","content":"I've got some interesting leads, but not nearly enough concrete mythology... Anyone else have any more leads or suggestions?<br /> <br /> If anyone has a link or example of a previously made Australian pantheon, that would also be extremely helpful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10163-toomuchjesus","name":"Toomuchjesus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-24T22:40:14-07:00","id":957420,"title":"","content":"Hi. Being an actual Australian (though not an Aboriginal one) I know a bit about Aborigine 'mythology'. Not much, to be honest, but I do know some.<br /> <br /> I'd be happy to try and answer some questions, if you want. Just a warning, though; It's been a while since I last heard/read the legends so I'll probably be a bit hazy. Also, I live in SA so I only really know the southern legends.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12300-crying","name":"Crying","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12300_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}